; Built-in car and truck dashboard of Rigs of Rods, drawn with DearIMGUI by AngelScript (imgui_car.as).
; It has no layout file on purpose: the script draws everything (see DashBoardManager::loadDashBoard()).
; Views: one combined gauge, two gauges (+ boost and tilt) or the full panel; every part can be hidden.
; Choose it in Settings > UI > Default truck dashboard. Vehicles with their own dashboard keep it.

dashboard_name "ImGui - Car"
dashboard_description "Built-in car and truck dashboard: one or two gauges with boost and tilt, or a full panel with gearbox, driving aids, lights, tyres and drive; adapts to diesel, petrol and electric engines"
dashboard_category   201
